OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,6,Ffurther showers, most frequent in
OL,7,FArgyll but becoming more scattered in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon as the winds continue to
OL,9,Fease down.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers becoming light and
OL,12,Fwell scattered this evening, and then
OL,13,Fdying out overnight though it will be
OL,14,Fmostly cloudy. A milder night.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FThursday will be mainly dry,
OL,17,Fthough quite cloudy with a few light
OL,18,Fshowers. Some sunshine around too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
